# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# Prettier is configured with its default endOfLine: "lf". Without this file a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF into the working tree,
# so `npm run format:check` fails on every file while CI (Linux, LF) passes.
# `eol=lf` pins the checkout regardless of the contributor's autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touch the bytes, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.AppImage binary
